Cell["\<\
This mini-notebook is the executable counterpart of \
whitehead-field-dynamics-computational-notes.tex. It records the local \
pair-averaging calculation, the exact small graph-of-graphs models, the two \
transition clocks, exact diffusion snapshots, one seeded path, and finite \
consensus products for K4 and Q3. Every displayed number is computed exactly \
before a decimal approximation is requested. Proofs remain in the full LaTeX \
manuscript.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "GoGComputationalNotes" -> <|"ID" -> "Abstract", "Generated" -> True|>|>,
 LineSpacing->{1.15, 2},
 FontSize->12,
 CellTags->{
  "GoGComputationalNotes", 
   "Abstract"},ExpressionUUID->"46d8de8c-c466-768e-ac8c-bf59592516b9"],

