   "SectionSetup"},ExpressionUUID->"4486bec3-2f90-a083-58e6-7be0232ea799"],

Cell["\<\
Keep this notebook in the repository root. Choose Evaluation > Evaluate \
Notebook to run the cells in order. The setup cell loads the repo-local \
GogFieldDynamics paclet; no global installation and no MathNotebook paclet \
are needed. SetReplace is optional and is not used by the displayed native \
sample path.\
\>", "Text",
