Cell["\<\
A settlement is a permutation matrix. It preserves sums and Euclidean norms, \
so it cannot change this one-step variance identity. It can change which \
persistent coordinate pair is averaged later; a quotient trajectory alone \
therefore does not reconstruct the full field cocycle.\
\>", "Text",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "GoGComputationalNotes" -> <|
    "ID" -> "SettlementBoundary", "Generated" -> True|>|>,
